{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Argyle Manor, Book 1: Away From The Sun",
    "steam_appid": 2876510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876510/extras/224f0b16a9e8b9949931475293529a9f.avif?t=1711666273\" width=616 height=300 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876510/extras/e9d34d49b5ad041fd3d663bf5c828633.avif?t=1711666273\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>Search a 3D haunted mansion, using slide-based point-and-click navigation in the style of old-school adventure games, to find ghosts and spooky concept art<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876510/extras/6e050ee2f0f85862d7346e37b158b6d3.avif?t=1711666273\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>Full of animated works of art, by professional artist Clayton Bryant Young and his daughter, game animator and designer Audrey Bryann Young.<br><br>Each piece is animated to rotate, showing first the original flat 2D image, and then revealing an extruded 3D sculptural version on the other side, sometimes with movement and sound.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876510/extras/bb7e9f086d24964483c6c03ee638ab23.avif?t=1711666273\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>An original ghost story faerietale about the haunted mansion and its characters, with 9 black &amp; white hand-drawn illustrations by novelist Carlene Bryann Young<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876510/extras/db77ab522586cfde73fab3b9f8ac7649.avif?t=1711666273\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>Books in the bookshelf share a story universe; they will eventually be able to link to their own 3D storybook world. Read/listen to sneak-peek story summaries, and see preview concept art!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876510/extras/50ba9c3c43974961602463961b53599e.avif?t=1711666273\" width=616 height=570 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876510/extras/41fafb994475e4ae883308ccbb8c3c77.avif?t=1711666273\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>This game was made by a tight-knit family of 4 artists: <br><br>Audrey Bryann Young (Animator; 3D Modeler, Illustrator, Concept Artist, Sound &amp; Game Designer), her sister Carlene Bryann Young (Writer; Co-Illustrator, Concept Artist and Game/UI Designer), Clayton Bryant Young (Oil Painter, Large-Scale Art Installation Designer), and Amber Young (Art Director)",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876510/extras/224f0b16a9e8b9949931475293529a9f.avif?t=1711666273\" width=616 height=300 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876510/extras/e9d34d49b5ad041fd3d663bf5c828633.avif?t=1711666273\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>Search a 3D haunted mansion, using slide-based point-and-click navigation in the style of old-school adventure games, to find ghosts and spooky concept art<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876510/extras/6e050ee2f0f85862d7346e37b158b6d3.avif?t=1711666273\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>Full of animated works of art, by professional artist Clayton Bryant Young and his daughter, game animator and designer Audrey Bryann Young.<br><br>Each piece is animated to rotate, showing first the original flat 2D image, and then revealing an extruded 3D sculptural version on the other side, sometimes with movement and sound.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876510/extras/bb7e9f086d24964483c6c03ee638ab23.avif?t=1711666273\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>An original ghost story faerietale about the haunted mansion and its characters, with 9 black &amp; white hand-drawn illustrations by novelist Carlene Bryann Young<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876510/extras/db77ab522586cfde73fab3b9f8ac7649.avif?t=1711666273\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>Books in the bookshelf share a story universe; they will eventually be able to link to their own 3D storybook world. Read/listen to sneak-peek story summaries, and see preview concept art!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876510/extras/50ba9c3c43974961602463961b53599e.avif?t=1711666273\" width=616 height=570 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876510/extras/41fafb994475e4ae883308ccbb8c3c77.avif?t=1711666273\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>This game was made by a tight-knit family of 4 artists: <br><br>Audrey Bryann Young (Animator; 3D Modeler, Illustrator, Concept Artist, Sound &amp; Game Designer), her sister Carlene Bryann Young (Writer; Co-Illustrator, Concept Artist and Game/UI Designer), Clayton Bryant Young (Oil Painter, Large-Scale Art Installation Designer), and Amber Young (Art Director)",
    "short_description": "Explore a haunted mansion gallery filled with 3D animated art - and ghosts - to unlock a full-length illustrated audiobook",
